ntrollers or your bare hands and play a complete game against the computer.\nFour AI difficulties: Easy, Normal, Hard, Expert.\nFull rules: castling, en passant, promotion, check, checkmate, stalemate,\nfifty-move rule, threefold repetition, and insufficient material.\nTranslucent hand visuals show your tracked hands while you play.\nTimers, legal-move highlights, undo, and confirm-move options.", "short_description": "Play chess on your table in mixed reality against four AI levels."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacy-policy-ar-chess-mixed/ana-sayfa", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Avar Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacy-policy-ar-chess-mixed/ana-sayfa", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": [], "id": "1488340347686534"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2578626795948268"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2578626795948268"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795019820, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2578626795948268"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1488512227669346", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "1677099000713924", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1488340337686535", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1488512227669346"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1677099000713924"}]}, "change_log": "# Release Notes \u2014 AR Chess Mixed Realty v1.0.0\r\n\r\nDeveloper: Avar Studios\r\nDate: 2026-11-14\r\nPackage: com.avarstudios.archess, versionCode 1\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n\r\nInitial release. A complete chess game in mixed reality for Meta Quest:\r\nplay on a marble board floating over your own table, against the computer.\r\n\r\n- Full chess rules: legal move generation, check, checkmate, stalemate,\r\n  castling, en passant, promotion, fifty-move rule, threefold repetition,\r\n  insufficient material, and game clocks with timeout.\r\n- Four AI difficulties from the floating setup menu: Easy, Normal, Hard,\r\n  Expert. Easy and Normal occasionally play human-like inaccuracies.\r\n- Two ways to play: Touch controllers (ray + trigger) or bare hands\r\n  (pinch to grab, poke for UI) with translucent hand visuals.\r\n- Legal-move highlights, undo support, confirm-move option, resign/restart,\r\n  win/lose messages, and per-side timers.\r\n- Fully offline single-player: boots straight into the chess table, no\r\n  account or internet connection required.\r\n\r\n## Devices\r\n\r\nMeta Quest 2, Quest Pro, Quest 3, Quest 3S. Best experienced on Quest 3/3S.\r\nPassthrough is full color on Quest 3/3S/Pro and grayscale on Quest 2\r\n(hardware limitation).\r\n\r\n## Known issues and notes\r\n\r\n- On first launch the OS may ask for microphone, spatial anchor, and scene\r\n  permissions; these support voice chat and room features of future updates.\r\n  The game plays fully without granting them.\r\n- Trophy/leaderboard and online multiplayer are not part of this release.\r\n\r\n## Verifying this package\r\n\r\nEach file in this folder is checksummed in SHA256SUMS. On Windows:\r\n\r\n    certutil -hashfile apk\\ARChessMixedRealty-v1.0.0.apk SHA256\r\n\r\nCompare the output with the matching line. The APK is signed with the\r\nAvar Studios release key (CN=Avar Studios, OU=Games, O=Avar Studios, C=TR).", "created_date": 1794641867, "id": "1488512227669346", "version": "1.0.0", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1488340337686535", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1488512227669346"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1677099000713924"}]}, "change_log": "# Release Notes \u2014 AR Chess Mixed Realty v1.0.0\r\n\r\nDeveloper: Avar Studios\r\nDate: 2026-11-14\r\nPackage: com.avarstudios.archess, versionCode 1\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n\r\nInitial release. A complete chess game in mixed reality for Meta Quest:\r\nplay on a marble board floating over your own table, against the computer.\r\n\r\n- Full chess rules: legal move generation, check, checkmate, stalemate,\r\n  castling, en passant, promotion, fifty-move rule, threefold repetition,\r\n  insufficient material, and game clocks with timeout.\r\n- Four AI difficulties from the floating setup menu: Easy, Normal, Hard,\r\n  Expert. Easy and Normal occasionally play human-like inaccuracies.\r\n- Two ways to play: Touch controllers (ray + trigger) or bare hands\r\n  (pinch to grab, poke for UI) with translucent hand visuals.\r\n- Legal-move highlights, undo support, confirm-move option, resign/restart,\r\n  win/lose messages, and per-side timers.\r\n- Fully offline single-player: boots straight into the chess table, no\r\n  account or internet connection required.\r\n\r\n## Devices\r\n\r\nMeta Quest 2, Quest Pro, Quest 3, Quest 3S. Best experienced on Quest 3/3S.\r\nPassthrough is full color on Quest 3/3S/Pro and grayscale on Quest 2\r\n(hardware limitation).\r\n\r\n## Known issues and notes\r\n\r\n- On first launch the OS may ask for microphone, spatial anchor, and scene\r\n  permissions; these support voice chat and room features of future updates.\r\n  The game plays fully without granting them.\r\n- Trophy/leaderboard and online multiplayer are not part of this release.\r\n\r\n## Verifying this package\r\n\r\nEach file in this folder is checksummed in SHA256SUMS. On Windows:\r\n\r\n    certutil -hashfile apk\\ARChessMixedRealty-v1.0.0.apk SHA256\r\n\r\nCompare the output with the matching line. The APK is signed with the\r\nAvar Studios release key (CN=Avar Studios, OU=Games, O=Avar Studios, C=TR).", "created_date": 1794640000, "id": "1488470967673472", "version": "1.0.0", "version_code": 1, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}